ics, strategic maneuvers, and even psychological attacks. And most importantly, you can conduct a battle and defeat the enemy in just 15 minutes. Specially designed graphics for the genre will finally help distinguish units from each other. We've put in the effort!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your commanders and dominate</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/2736cb16d99e5c416f0abe2e68a68030.poster.avif?t=1739545385\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/2736cb16d99e5c416f0abe2e68a68030.webm?t=1739545385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/2736cb16d99e5c416f0abe2e68a68030.mp4?t=1739545385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In League of Masters, there are a whopping 12 unique commanders! Each has its own abilities that increase damage and enhance tactics. Even if your opponents lack experience and skills, their commanders can be much stronger than yours, so you always need to be on guard and adjust your strategy as the battle unfolds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose fighters wisely</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/f2274f11b886ff748f71fe8426dcb419.poster.avif?t=1739545385\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/f2274f11b886ff748f71fe8426dcb419.webm?t=1739545385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/f2274f11b886ff748f71fe8426dcb419.mp4?t=1739545385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Demon or genie? Mage or archer? The game features over 50 units of different classes and synergies for both PvP and PvE battles. Just look at how powerful they are! Assemble an unbeatable team and test different strategies to find the perfect one.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafted by strategists for strategists</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/44e5e6f6fc55b48cc3764958621aea6b.poster.avif?t=1739545385\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/44e5e6f6fc55b48cc3764958621aea6b.webm?t=1739545385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808830/extras/44e5e6f6fc55b48cc3764958621aea6b.mp4?t=1739545385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Our team consists almost entirely of players with 20 years of experience, who prioritize skill and knowledge over grind and unfair play. League of Masters is pure strategy, endless possibilities, and fair competition.",
